, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Urban expansion GIS project"},{"text":"Flood/disaster-risk mapping project"},{"text":"Agricultural or vegetation remote-sensing project"},{"text":"Python-based geospatial automation project"},{"text":"PostGIS spatial database project"},{"text":"Google Earth Engine project"},{"text":"One advanced GIS + ML capstone"},{"text":"Industry internship"},{"text":"GitHub portfolio"},{"text":"Professional GIS/remote-sensing resume"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Remote Sensing & GIS → GIS Fundamentals → Cartography → Remote Sensing → QGIS/ArcGIS → Google Earth Engine → Python/GeoPandas → SQL/PostGIS → Spatial Statistics → GIS Automation → Machine Learning → Internship → Geospatial Data Assistant → GIS/Remote Sensing Analyst → Geospatial Data Analyst/Engineer → Geospatial AI Specialist."},{"type":"table","header":["ID","Level","Stream","UG Degree","Specialisation","Target Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"943"},{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)"},{"text":"Remote Sensing & GIS"},{"text":"Surveying Assistant"}]]}]}]}